cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with the
  open-source solvers that produced the results (see the README).
type: software
title: "MPSim: Material Property Simulation"
abstract: >-
  MPSim (Material Property Simulation) is a browser-based simulator for
  the effective properties of a single
  material layer - filled composites, porous media and thin films for
  semiconductor packaging, devices and process equipment - computed on a
  voxel representative volume element (RVE). It generates the
  microstructure, checks that the RVE is representative, solves thermal,
  electrical, dielectric, magnetic, mechanical, rheological, moisture,
  flow and electromagnetic-shielding problems with validated open-source
  solvers, and shows the fields in an interactive 3D view.
